sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Web
    participant API
    participant LLM
    participant Arxiv
    participant DB as SQLite

    User->>Web: Tạo project
    Web->>API: projects.create
    API->>DB: Insert project

    User->>Web: Yêu cầu interpretation
    Web->>API: interpretation.generate
    API->>LLM: Structured interpretation request
    LLM-->>API: JSON proposal
    API->>DB: Persist PROPOSED interpretation

    User->>API: interpretation.confirm
    API->>DB: Persist USER_CONFIRMED

    User->>API: decomposition.generate
    API->>LLM: Structured decomposition request
    LLM-->>API: Nodes and relations
    API->>DB: Persist graph and status history

    User->>API: literature.searchWithAnalysis
    API->>LLM: Request search tool call
    LLM-->>API: search_arxiv arguments
    API->>Arxiv: Execute validated search
    Arxiv-->>API: Paper metadata
    API->>LLM: Relevance and analysis request
    API->>DB: Persist sources

    User->>API: Select corpus and generate design
    API->>LLM: Gap, claim and experiment requests
    API->>DB: Persist research design

    User->>API: specGeneration.generate
    API->>DB: Read workflow data
    API->>DB: Persist new 14-section version

    User->>API: judge.runPanel
    par Five independent calls
        API->>LLM: Gap Judge
        API->>LLM: Contribution Judge
        API->>LLM: Experiment Judge
        API->>LLM: Evidence Judge
        API->>LLM: Conference Readiness Judge
    end
    API->>API: Compute deterministic consensus
    API->>DB: Persist Judge panel

    User->>API: Resolve finding / rerun / diff
    API->>DB: Persist resolution and versions

    User->>API: revision.finalize
    API->>DB: Persist FINALIZED status
